From 6e0e93f8d7d72237122bfc27cbc7cdc6fd5f364c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:03:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] docs/Project.toml: SpeedyWeather and Terrarium compat as in
 test/ (missed in #963 and #968)

The workspace (root, docs, examples, test) is resolved as a whole, so docs' compat binds every CI job. #963 widened
SpeedyWeather to 0.23-0.26 in Project.toml and test/, #968 added Terrarium 0.2 in Project.toml, test/ and examples/;
docs/ kept SpeedyWeather 0.23, 0.24 and Terrarium 0.1.10. Terrarium's main (0.2.0-DEV, the [sources] pin) now needs
SpeedyWeatherInternals 1.0.1, which only SpeedyWeather 0.25 allows, so instantiating any environment fails:
Unsatisfiable requirements detected for package Terrarium.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvpKgDchWb93a6aYpaq
---
 docs/Project.toml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/Project.toml b/docs/Project.toml
index 2032cf5a..50966122 100755
--- a/docs/Project.toml
+++ b/docs/Project.toml
@@ -50,5 +50,5 @@ Enzyme = "0.13.166"
 Literate = "2.2"
 Oceananigans = "0.117.2, 0.118"
 Reactant = "0.2.278"
-SpeedyWeather = "0.23, 0.24"
-Terrarium = "0.1.10"
+SpeedyWeather = "0.23, 0.24, 0.25, 0.26"
+Terrarium = "0.1.10, 0.2"
-- 
2.43.0

